# Grafana scans every provisioning subdirectory at boot and logs an ERROR for each one that is
# absent:
#   "can't read alerting provisioning files from directory" ... no such file or directory
#   "Failed to read plugin provisioning files from directory" ... no such file or directory
# Two errors on every single start, in a stack whose alerting was genuinely broken — noise that
# trains operators to ignore Grafana's error log. Empty is a valid, silent configuration; missing
# is not.
